Mount capacitors to your shield that dampen the impact of attacks, increasing block value by [15%, 23%, 29%, 35%, 40% (TL1-5)] and storing 100% of the damage blocked as an electrical charge (to a maximum of [248, 334, 401, 458, 508 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)]).

Activating this ability discharges blocked damage, firing a bolt of lightning dealing [113%, 118%, 123%, 126%, 130% (TL1-5)] shield damage as lightning to the first target, then projecting a bolt of lightning that arcs to [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] other targets dealing lightning damage equal to the stored amount.

If at maximum charge, this also dazes for 2 turns and the shield strike is a guarenteed critical hit.

The maximum damage you can absorb will increase with your Steampower.
